TEXT 0 320 Left 2 ;TWEETER in the DALI box, port closed (Lab D, Fig. 1). Re = 3.4 (lab). Voice coil = Le in series with L2||R2 (lossy-inductance model), valid 100 Hz - 21 kHz.\nMechanical loop: Mmd = moving mass, Rms = mechanical loss, Cms = effective compliance (fs = 1.42 kHz, peak 6.7 Ohm).\nBl = 3 Tm is a nominal scaling choice: |Z| only depends on Bl^2/Zm, so if you know the real Bl scale Mmd and Rms by (Bl/3)^2 and Cms by (3/Bl)^2. No acoustic section (Sd unknown). Impedance: plot 1/I(Vd1).
